    "id": "ikyhwm-2025",
    "title": "IKYHWM",
    "role": "An interactive lyric visualiser built with WebGL for the debut single from 'LIGHTS ON'. Features real-time beat detection driving dynamic visual effects—from liquid displacement and chromatic aberration to barrel distortion and film grain. The system uses 3D Simplex noise for organic animations, syncs lyric typography to audio cues, and layers multiple rendering canvases for rich compositing. Users experience reactive visuals that pulse, warp, and transform with every beat.",
    "composer": "",
    "year": "2025",
    "image": "/assets/images/crp_ikyhwm1_2025.png",
    "link": "https://github.com/philtersoup/ikyhwm",
    "category": "Creative Technology",
